   "title": "0.1 — Course profile (official FLM syllabus)|||0.1 — Hồ sơ môn học (syllabus FLM chính thức)",
   "slug": "prn222-flm-0-1-ho-so-mon",
   "type": "DOCUMENT",
   "isFreePreview": true,
   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PRN222 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.1</span>\n<h2>Course profile, as the university publishes it</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Advanced Cross-Platform Application Programming With .NET — the official numbers: credits, hours, prerequisite and the decision that issued this syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13892 · Decision 1402/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 12/12/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PRN222 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.1</span>\n<h2>Hồ sơ môn học, đúng như trường công bố</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Advanced Cross-Platform Application Programming With .NET — các con số chính thức: tín chỉ, giờ học, môn tiên quyết và quyết định ban hành syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13892 · QĐ 1402/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 12/12/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Subject code</span><span class=\"v\">PRN222</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus name</span><span class=\"v\">Advanced Cross-Platform Application Programming With .NET_Lập trình ứng dụng đa nền tảng nâng cao với .NET</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Credits</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Degree level</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Time allocation</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h) = 49.5h contact hours + 145' Final exam + 98.1h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Prerequisite</span><span class=\"v\">PRN212</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Teaching method</span><span class=\"v\">Social Constructivism,In-class lecture,Inquiry-based Teaching</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Scoring scale</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Minimum average to pass</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">13892</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Decision</span><span class=\"v\">1402/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 12/12/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Approved date</span><span class=\"v\">12/12/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Sessions in the plan</span><span class=\"v\">66</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Mã môn</span><span class=\"v\">PRN222</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Tên syllabus</span><span class=\"v\">Advanced Cross-Platform Application Programming With .NET_Lập trình ứng dụng đa nền tảng nâng cao với .NET</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số tín chỉ</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Bậc đào tạo</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phân bổ thời gian</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h) = 49.5h contact hours + 145' Final exam + 98.1h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Môn tiên quyết</span><span class=\"v\">PRN212</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phương pháp dạy – học</span><span class=\"v\">Social Constructivism,In-class lecture,Inquiry-based Teaching</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Thang điểm</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">13892</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Quyết định ban hành</span><span class=\"v\">1402/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 12/12/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Ngày duyệt</span><span class=\"v\">12/12/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số buổi trong kế hoạch</span><span class=\"v\">66</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Description (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>Upon completion of this course students should:<br><br>1. Understand the followings:<br><br>• Apply C# language for developing tranditional and realtime communication Web applications;<br><br>• Fundamental concepts of .NET Core Platform<br><br>• Basic knowledge of ASP.NET Core with Realtime Communication using SignalR<br><br>• Basic knowledge of ASP.NET Core MVC, Razor Pages, Blazor with tranditional Web App and apply into ASP.NET Core application<br><br>• Basic knowledge of Asynchronous and Parallel Programming in .NET Core application<br><br>• Basic knowledge of Dependency Injection apply into .NET Core applications<br><br>• Basic knowledge of Worker Service and apply to implement Background Tasks<br><br>2. Be able to:<br><br>• Develop Cross - platform Web applications by ASP.NET Core MVC, Razor Pages, Blazor<br><br>• Implement Real-time applications by Signal R and ASP.NET Core<br><br>• Implement Background Tasks with Worker Service<br><br>3. Be able to work in a team and present group's results</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Mô tả môn học (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>Upon completion of this course students should:<br><br>1. Understand the followings:<br><br>• Apply C# language for developing tranditional and realtime communication Web applications;<br><br>• Fundamental concepts of .NET Core Platform<br><br>• Basic knowledge of ASP.NET Core with Realtime Communication using SignalR<br><br>• Basic knowledge of ASP.NET Core MVC, Razor Pages, Blazor with tranditional Web App and apply into ASP.NET Core application<br><br>• Basic knowledge of Asynchronous and Parallel Programming in .NET Core application<br><br>• Basic knowledge of Dependency Injection apply into .NET Core applications<br><br>• Basic knowledge of Worker Service and apply to implement Background Tasks<br><br>2. Be able to:<br><br>• Develop Cross - platform Web applications by ASP.NET Core MVC, Razor Pages, Blazor<br><br>• Implement Real-time applications by Signal R and ASP.NET Core<br><br>• Implement Background Tasks with Worker Service<br><br>3. Be able to work in a team and present group's results</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13892\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13892</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13892\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13892</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
